                    "          {\"nkey\": \"UBERXOSHFHFLL7YEXXH7RYEJLK455TF4BOZLIHD5R6NF5FFISNHEXIZO\", \"permissions\": {\"publish\": {\"allow\": [\"$JS.API.INFO\", \"$JS.API.STREAM.NAMES\", \"$JS.API.STREAM.LIST\", \"$JS.API.STREAM.INFO.*\", \"$JS.API.CONSUMER.NAMES.*\", \"$JS.API.CONSUMER.LIST.*\", \"$JS.API.CONSUMER.INFO.*.*\", \"$JS.API.DIRECT.GET.KV_example_bucket.$KV.example_bucket.lease.>\", \"$JS.API.STREAM.CREATE.EXAMPLE_MEASURE\", \"$JS.API.STREAM.UPDATE.EXAMPLE_MEASURE\", \"$JS.API.STREAM.DELETE.EXAMPLE_MEASURE\", \"example-measure.>\"]}, \"subscribe\": {\"allow\": [\"_INBOX_example_measure.>\"]}}}",
